flowchart LR
    CLI[github-issue create flags] --> Build[Typed dispatch builder]
    File[Advanced request file] --> Dispatch[Shared operational dispatch]
    Build --> Dispatch
    Dispatch --> Gate{v3 authority active?}
    Gate -->|no| Stop[Fail closed]
    Gate -->|yes| Intent[Durable intent and marker]
    Intent --> GitHub[Authenticated GitHub mutation]
    GitHub --> Readback[Assigned-number readback]
    Readback --> Receipt[Mutation receipt and reconciliation]
